  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c7262b0d-9998-41d4-8b9c-e853f3f56b8d",
    "name": "LIVEKINDLY Content API (WordPress REST wp/v2) Settings API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "LIVEKINDLY Collective publishes thelivekindlyco.com on WordPress, which exposes the WordPress REST API at https://thelivekindlyco.com/wp-json/. The wp/v2 namespace is anonymously readable and returns the company newsroom and LiveKindly Blog, corporate pages, the `brand` directory (Fry’s Family Food Co., Like Meat, Oumph!, The No Meat Company), the `partner` directory (PHW Group, RCL Foods, Ospelt, Coest), the `job` careers listings, the media library, taxonomies and a site-wide search endpoint as JSON.\n\nThis document was DERIVED mechanically by API Evangelist from the route-discovery document served at https://thelivekindlyco.com/wp-json/ on 2026-08-04 — every path, method and parameter below is taken verbatim from that descriptor. LIVEKINDLY does not publish an OpenAPI definition of its own, and this is not a product API: it is the content API the CMS exposes. Write operations exist on these routes but require authentication (WordPress Application Passwords over HTTP Basic).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: LIVEKINDLY Collective",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
